/**
 * @file NetworkRunFields.cpp
 * @brief The run remainder's field declarations (card NOM step N4g): @c net::kRunFields.
 *
 * One row per member of @c NetworkCarryState left in the run state (and per member of its
 * @c ResumeHandoff group), and one per member that step N4g moved to
 * @c NetworkServiceCounters, so every former @c NetworkCarryState member has exactly one
 * @c FieldDecl row here or in an entity table (G1, checked by scripts/nom_n4_verify.py
 * --whole).  @c name is the path from the run context ("carry.prev_carry",
 * "carry.resume.adm", "counters.carry_born_total"); @c was is the former member.  The
 * rows carry no functions: a run record keeps its copy block in the snapshot writer and
 * reader, and the reach table samples the entity tables only.  Generated from
 * scripts/nom3_designs/N4_fields.tsv (persistence column); a new run member gets its row
 * here in the same commit.
 */
